# Reputation Graph Spec

ReputationGraph records contextual trust derived from protocol events.

```json
{
  "entity_id": "skill_001",
  "scope": "code_review",
  "score": 0.91,
  "success_count": 120,
  "failure_count": 8,
  "dispute_count": 2
}
```

## Edge Types

```text
owns_node
provides_capability
invokes
produces_proof
verifies
settles
updates_wallet
updates_reputation
emits_event
```
